      {
        "id": "forenoon-afternoon",
        "label": {
          "en": "The forenoon or afternoon of relief is stated",
          "hi": "कार्यमुक्ति का पूर्वाह्न या अपराह्न लिखा है"
        },
        "why": {
          "en": "Pay, allowances and the joining time all run from the half-day of relief. An order that gives only a date leaves the receiving office to guess.",
