                "text": "Consequent upon the transfer of {{officerName}}, {{officerDesignation}}, to {{newOffice}} vide order No. {{transferOrder}} dated {{transferDate}}, the officer is relieved of the duties of this office with effect from the {{reliefTime}} of {{reliefDate}}."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "numberedPara",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 1
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The officer has handed over charge to {{chargeTo}} and there are no dues outstanding against the officer in this office as on the date of relief."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "hi": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "numberedPara",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 1
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "आदेश संख्या {{transferOrder}} दिनांक {{transferDate}} द्वारा {{officerName}}, {{officerDesignation}} के {{newOffice}} में स्थानांतरण के फलस्वरूप, अधिकारी को {{reliefDate}} के {{reliefTime}} से इस कार्यालय के कर्तव्यों से कार्यमुक्त किया जाता है।"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "numberedPara",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 1
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "अधिकारी ने {{chargeTo}} को कार्यभार सौंप दिया है और कार्यमुक्ति की तिथि तक इस कार्यालय में अधिकारी पर कोई देय बकाया नहीं है।"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
